{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"readonly","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MLNOfflinePackState","preciseIdentifier":"c:@E@MLNOfflinePackState","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackState","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"state","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The state of an inactive or completed pack is computed lazily and is set to"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackState\/MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" by default. To request the pack’s status, use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"-requestProgress","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method. To get notified when the state becomes known and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when it changes, observe KVO change notifications on this pack’s "},{"code":"state","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path. Alternatively, you can add an observer for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s about this pack that come from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default notification center."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject